OL,3,GNEWSAThousands to celebrate Diwali
OL,4,Aacross North West
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people are preparing to
OL,7,Fenjoy food, music and fireworks as
OL,8,FHindus across north-west England are
OL,9,Fset to celebrate Diwali.
OL,11,FAbout 600 are expected for the festival
OL,12,Fat the Gujarat Hindu Society in
OL,13,FPreston, Lancashire, on Sunday, which
OL,14,Fopens with prayers and features a
OL,15,Ffireworks display finale.
OL,17,FIshwer Tailor, vice president of the
OL,18,Ftemple, which celebrated its 50th
OL,19,Fanniversary last year, said it had been
OL,20,Fplanning the events for a month.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
