OL,3,GNEWSAThousands to celebrate Diwali
OL,4,Aacross North West
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said Diwali was a "fun" celebration
OL,7,Fwhere people come together at the
OL,8,Ftemple throughout the day with the
OL,9,F"spectacle" of the shrine decorated
OL,10,Fwith lamps "and plenty of sweets for
OL,11,Feveryone".
